    "actor_description": "Something slams into my nervous system—instant, electric. Every neuron fires at once. My head whips toward it before I know I've moved, pulse spiking hard in my throat, flooding my limbs with readiness. I'm not thinking. I'm locked—body coiled, senses thrumming, everything narrowed to that one point. Whatever this is, I'm already bracing for it.",
    "description_text": "{actor} jolts hard—head snapping toward the source, eyes going wide and fixed. Their entire frame tightens in an instant: shoulders rising, muscles coiling, weight shifting to the balls of their feet. Breath catches sharp and high, then comes quick and shallow. Every line of their body radiates taut readiness, attention laser-focused as if everything else just disappeared.",
